                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "You ask what is so exciting about the Ice School? Well, when I was a young girl, I loved the wintertime and played in the snow. So going to the Ice School was only natural.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_Greyrose_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfLydiaGreyrose_QST_05.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 38172,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "But in later years, I grew to learn how powerful Ice was. Did you know the Great Raven caused the Giants to slumber and turn into the glaciers?",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_Greyrose_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfLydiaGreyrose_QST_06.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 38172,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              },
              {
                "$type": "Imcodec.ObjectProperty.TypeCache.NPCDialogEntry, Imcodec.ObjectProperty",
                "m_personaName": "WC-RAV-NPC03_Persona",
                "m_nameOverride": "",
                "m_nameSTKey": null,
                "m_guiDisplay": "",
                "m_maxTimeSeconds": 0,
                "m_invisible": false,
                "m_requirements": null,
                "m_dialog": "With the force of Giants behind our school, I don't have to boast about how powerful our Magic is. I have never regretted the day I started here.",
                "m_picture": "GUI/NpcPortraits/Portrait_Human_Greyrose_A_NPC.dds",
                "m_soundFile": "|Sound_Dialogue|WorldData|Sound/Dialogue/ProfLydiaGreyrose_QST_07.mp3",
                "m_action": "",
                "m_dialogEvent": "",
                "m_actorTemplateID": 38172,
                "m_cameraName": ""
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
